<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハエ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>A single fly had been buzzing around for a while.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
We laid <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> down next to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By tomorrow morning, these sisters would have their own moving reunion too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"You came, so that means you're prepared for this, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Gradually my eyes adjusted to the dark, and I could make out <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s sake she had always dressed beautifully and never neglected her looks, but there was no trace of that <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her face was gaunt, and her clothes were so worn I couldn't tell how many days in a row she'd had them on.<PG>
The clothes <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つ">hanging</STYLE> on the wall, which were <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s, were neat and well kept.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Her striking long black hair was the same as before, and she didn't look any thinner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was probably spending as much of their living money as she could on <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They seemed to be living even more poorly than I'd imagined.<PG>
Just because of that accident, <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was going through hardship she never should have had to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Poverty with no end in sight, and bullying at school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understood all too painfully how she wanted to save <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> no matter what.<PG>
No, now that I'd seen this situation, I wanted to save <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> too! Absolutely...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I've memorized the faces and addresses of the two doing the bullying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Tell me the time, the place and the method."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no hesitation in the words <STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE> suddenly spoke.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, there's nothing wrong with just listening, is there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE> didn't turn her face to me, but kept her eyes on <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let out a heavy sigh and sat down without a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were only going to listen, nothing more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could find even the slightest way to get through this without killing, no, I meant to push this toward not killing at all, no matter what.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Tomorrow, use these."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\putting_a_box.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\箱.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> brought over a big cardboard box she'd kept in the corner of the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked pretty heavy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\能面セット.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"First, these. Hide your builds and your faces with the red robes and the Noh masks."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These red robes were awfully heavy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was something metal inside them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were small knives, with blades about 10 cm long.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lots of them were sewn in.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you can't go as far as killing with knives like these, can you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="6">A real weapon, or a way not to get caught―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Those are spares. What you'll really use is this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\putting_a_box.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\鉈とハンマー.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
What <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> took out of another box was a large blade and a dully gleaming blunt weapon.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"A nata and... what's this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A mace. Do it with these. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Use the spare knives as needed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hold on. With gear like this, even a man would be too weighed down to move freely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Even a kid could get away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I played along for the moment, but of course I had no intention of using any of it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"When the time comes, this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
What <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> took out were two syringes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"With this, you'll be in a state of excitement for about 10 minutes, and your physical ability goes up dramatically. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A mace will be as good as cotton candy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What is this, some kind of doping drug?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A drug that takes the limiter off your muscles and lets you call up the strength you only find in an emergency at will, apparently."</STYLE><PG>
I'd heard of drugs that improve athletic ability, but a drug strong enough to make tomorrow's crime possible?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suspicious. Hadn't someone sold her something shady?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, how did you get your hands on all this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I hate to say it, but living like this, there's no way you could put together this much. And the drug too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The nata was polished clean, and the red robes weren't cheap either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This must have cost a lot of money.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The Arata settlement, where </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s family home is, sent it to me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it was the Arata settlement after all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only about 30 people lived there, and its character was extremely insular.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because of that, the settlement's <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="きずな">bonds</STYLE> and solidarity were strong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE> used to say it often. One for all, all for one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the Arata settlement's slogan.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The Arata settlement is a village built 800 years ago by people fleeing the wars of the world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Over hundreds of years, people with nowhere else to go, like drifters and Westerners, gathered there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It's an insular settlement, but once you're accepted as one of them, they'll protect their own by any means necessary. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's the people of the Arata settlement."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\戦.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Long ago, warlords and bandits appeared who plotted to invade Arata, with its rich nature and plentiful food. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But the residents fought to protect the only place they had, and they armed themselves as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's why, even now, there's a lasting tradition that the residents stay ready to fight at any time."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪山.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"You remember I went to Arata for a year, right? Back then, I was given that kind of training. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hunting animals without guns or any firearms, being left alone in the mountains for ages... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハエ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Once, I was even taught how to fight with this nata and mace. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー鉈.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Like this."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\鉈エフェクト.gal" "WAIT" "3" "100" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "3" "100" "540" "1" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> swung the nata, there was a faint snip in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ハエ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
What dropped onto the tatami was a fly, cut in half lengthwise.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd swung a heavy nata in this dark room and cut a fly in midair?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Being able to do this doesn't make me invincible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If I got into a fistfight with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, there's no way I'd win. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This is within the range of what a human can do with training."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This drug is what breaks through that limit. For 10 minutes, it lets a person use 100% of their muscle strength. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I've never used it, but its effect has been proven over hundreds of years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Apparently in the old days they used it by burning the drug's crystals and breathing the smoke."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\戦.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"They say that as they resisted the armies that attacked the Arata settlement, this drug was eventually invented, and they could fight more efficiently."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\能面セット.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"But there were times when they had no choice but to leave the settlement to get supplies. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So when they fought, they wore masks, so that in peacetime they could go outside the settlement with their faces bare without arousing suspicion. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">At some point, the masks settled into Noh masks, I hear."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\大魔女能面立ち絵用.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Through the Westerners who drifted into the Arata settlement, the 'witch' and the 'shinigami' came to be known. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What the Arata settlement calls a witch is what we'd now call a priest. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The shinigami are, literally, those who have died.</STYLE> [TN: shinigami is written with the characters for death and god.] 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When someone in the settlement dies, a witch presides over the memorial service, and the mourners wear Noh masks that hide their expressions and faces, so the shinigami won't mark them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Around that same time―a certain Westerner, who was also a doctor, took an interest in a certain plant in the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What was extracted from that plant is this drug. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I don't know exactly how it works, but thanks to it, the Arata settlement has kept its autonomy right down to the present day."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The shinigami, the god that brings death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The nata and the mace are what the sword is to a samurai. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The drug that aids the fighting. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And the knives sewn inside are both weapon and armor. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This is the shinigami's―the Arata settlement's formal battle dress."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That's why things like this come from the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">One for all, all for one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If a comrade outside the settlement is in trouble, they lend a hand like this."</STYLE><PG>
It was a hard story to follow, but it should be enough to grasp that the Arata settlement made a tradition of fighting for its land and its people.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, wait a second. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If the settlement would go that far for you, why don't you move there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The rules don't allow it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When an outsider like me doesn't live in the settlement right after the marriage, she isn't allowed to put down roots there until the child turns 16. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And arming yourself outside the settlement is forbidden too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Arms are strictly for protecting the settlement, not for invading. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Helping outsiders is forbidden too, so I can't get any help with living costs either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"One for all, all for one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You might think what I've said contradicts that slogan... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But the people of Arata are all timid. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So even with a slogan like that, it takes a good amount of time before an outsider like me is trusted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even in this day and age..."</STYLE><PG>
In other words, the Arata settlement wouldn't lend a hand directly, and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> couldn't live there until she turned 16.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, it was a contradiction for things like this to reach <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever the form, they were helping her, weren't they?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that mean someone inside the settlement was a secret accomplice?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right now it's all I can do to somehow keep </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> from going hungry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is all I live for..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Saying that, she ran her hand over <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s head, <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="な">stroking</STYLE> it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"My parents have passed away, and I have no brothers or sisters. There's no one left I can rely on... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The truth is, I could do it myself tomorrow, but if I got arrested, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would have nowhere to go... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if you two lend me a hand, it's easier to fool the people around us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would I do if I were in <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s position?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To protect <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, surely even I might...<PG>
No, I mustn't think like that! There are things you can do precisely because you aren't the one in it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then let me meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, the head of Arata! I'll talk to her directly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's impossible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is against this kind of violence. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Besides, even as the head of the settlement, she isn't allowed to break Arata's </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おきて">rules</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So I haven't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> about this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I asked 'someone I can trust' in the settlement."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Someone you can trust?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. Someone I can trust..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had no intention of saying who this 'someone I can trust' was.<PG>
To sum up, the settlement couldn't openly help <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But someone was secretly in league with <STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and supporting her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A money trail might be traced, so it came as supplies like these...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't mind being punished for breaking the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おきて">rules</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But then 'someone I can trust' would be punished too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So this can't be made public in the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then why not come back to Motoki-cho?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I don't earn much, but I think I could manage to support two more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
